{"version":1,"id":"matematicas-2012-reserva-1","asignatura":"matematicas","anio":2012,"convocatoria":"Reserva 1","documento":"MAT-2012-RESERVA_1.pdf","ejercicios":[{"id":"matematicas-2012-reserva-1-1","n":1,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sea la función \\(f:(0,+\\infty)\\to\\mathbb R\\) definida por \\(f(x)=\\dfrac1x+\\ln(x)\\) donde \\(\\ln\\) denota la función logaritmo neperiano.","apartados":["(1,75 p.) Halla los extremos absolutos de \\(f\\) (abscisas donde se obtienen y valores que se alcanzan) en el intervalo \\(\\left[\\frac1e,e\\right]\\).","(0,75 p.) Determina la ecuación de la recta tangente a la gráfica de \\(f\\) en el punto de abscisa \\(x=e\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(f\\) es continua en \\(\\left[\\frac1e,e\\right]\\): alcanza máximo y mínimo absolutos<i class='n' data-t='th'>Teorema de Weierstrass: una función continua en un intervalo cerrado alcanza su máximo y su mínimo absolutos.</i>. Estudiamos el signo de \\(f'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>.</p>\\[f'(x)=-\\frac1{x^2}+\\frac1x=\\frac{x-1}{x^2}=0\\iff\\boxed{x=1}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 228 108' width='100%' style='max-width:274px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H214' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M14 56L18 48M18 56L22 48M22 56L26 48M26 56L30 48M30 56L34 48M34 56L38 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M190 56L194 48M194 56L198 48M198 56L202 48M202 56L206 48M206 56L210 48M210 56L214 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M40 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='40' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>1/e</text><path d='M114 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='114' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>1</text><path d='M188 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='188' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>e</text><text x='51.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M65.0 10L101.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M92.0 39L101.0 40L99.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='77.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(½) &lt; 0</text><text x='125.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M139.0 40L175.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M166.0 11L175.0 10L173.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='151.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(2) &gt; 0</text></svg></div><p>\\(f\\) decrece en \\(\\left(\\frac1e,1\\right)\\) y crece en \\((1,e)\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece en él; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i>. Comparo los candidatos:</p>\\[f\\left(\\frac1e\\right)=e-1\\approx1{,}72,\\qquad f(1)=1,\\qquad f(e)=\\frac1e+1\\approx1{,}37\\]<div class='res'>Mínimo absoluto en \\(x=1\\), de valor \\(1\\). Máximo absoluto en \\(x=\\frac1e\\), de valor \\(e-1\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[f(e)=\\frac1e+1,\\qquad f'(e)=\\frac{e-1}{e^2}\\]<div class='res'>\\(y-\\left(1+\\dfrac1e\\right)=\\dfrac{e-1}{e^2}(x-e)\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"mono","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"tang","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2012-RESERVA_1.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2012-reserva-1-2","n":2,"num":2,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sean \\(f,g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) las funciones definidas por \\(f(x)=\\mathrm{sen}(x)\\) y \\(g(x)=\\cos(x)\\) respectivamente.","apartados":["(0,75 p.) Realiza un esbozo de las gráficas de \\(f\\) y \\(g\\) en el intervalo \\(\\left[0,\\frac\\pi2\\right]\\).","(1,75 p.) Calcula el área total de los recintos limitados por ambas gráficas y las rectas \\(x=0\\) y \\(x=\\frac\\pi2\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>En \\(\\left[0,\\frac\\pi2\\right]\\), \\(\\mathrm{sen}\\,x\\) crece de 0 a 1 y \\(\\cos x\\) decrece de 1 a 0. Se cortan donde \\(\\mathrm{tg}\\,x=1\\): \\(x=\\frac\\pi4\\).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 180' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='46.0,44.1 49.4,44.2 52.8,44.3 56.2,44.4 59.6,44.7 63.0,45.0 66.4,45.3 69.8,45.8 73.2,46.2 76.6,46.8 80.0,47.4 83.4,48.1 86.8,48.9 90.2,49.7 93.6,50.6 97.1,51.5 100.5,52.5 103.9,53.5 107.3,54.7 110.7,55.8 114.1,57.1 117.5,58.4 120.9,59.7 124.3,61.1 127.7,62.6 131.1,64.1 134.5,65.7 137.9,67.3 141.3,68.9 144.7,70.7 148.1,72.4 151.5,70.7 154.9,68.9 158.3,67.3 161.7,65.7 165.1,64.1 168.5,62.6 171.9,61.1 175.3,59.7 178.7,58.4 182.1,57.1 185.5,55.8 188.9,54.7 192.3,53.5 195.7,52.5 199.2,51.5 202.6,50.6 206.0,49.7 209.4,48.9 212.8,48.1 216.2,47.4 219.6,46.8 223.0,46.2 226.4,45.8 229.8,45.3 233.2,45.0 236.6,44.7 240.0,44.4 243.4,44.3 246.8,44.2 250.2,44.1 250.2,140.7 246.8,138.2 243.4,135.6 240.0,133.1 236.6,130.6 233.2,128.1 229.8,125.6 226.4,123.1 223.0,120.6 219.6,118.2 216.2,115.7 212.8,113.3 209.4,110.9 206.0,108.5 202.6,106.1 199.2,103.7 195.7,101.4 192.3,99.1 188.9,96.9 185.5,94.6 182.1,92.4 178.7,90.2 175.3,88.1 171.9,86.0 168.5,83.9 165.1,81.9 161.7,79.9 158.3,78.0 154.9,76.1 151.5,74.2 148.1,72.4 144.7,74.2 141.3,76.1 137.9,78.0 134.5,79.9 131.1,81.9 127.7,83.9 124.3,86.0 120.9,88.1 117.5,90.2 114.1,92.4 110.7,94.6 107.3,96.9 103.9,99.1 100.5,101.4 97.1,103.7 93.6,106.1 90.2,108.5 86.8,110.9 83.4,113.3 80.0,115.7 76.6,118.2 73.2,120.6 69.8,123.1 66.4,125.6 63.0,128.1 59.6,130.6 56.2,133.1 52.8,135.6 49.4,138.2 46.0,140.7' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='46.0,140.7 49.4,138.2 52.8,135.6 56.2,133.1 59.6,130.6 63.0,128.1 66.4,125.6 69.8,123.1 73.2,120.6 76.6,118.2 80.0,115.7 83.4,113.3 86.8,110.9 90.2,108.5 93.6,106.1 97.1,103.7 100.5,101.4 103.9,99.1 107.3,96.9 110.7,94.6 114.1,92.4 117.5,90.2 120.9,88.1 124.3,86.0 127.7,83.9 131.1,81.9 134.5,79.9 137.9,78.0 141.3,76.1 144.7,74.2 148.1,72.4 151.5,70.7 154.9,68.9 158.3,67.3 161.7,65.7 165.1,64.1 168.5,62.6 171.9,61.1 175.3,59.7 178.7,58.4 182.1,57.1 185.5,55.8 188.9,54.7 192.3,53.5 195.7,52.5 199.2,51.5 202.6,50.6 206.0,49.7 209.4,48.9 212.8,48.1 216.2,47.4 219.6,46.8 223.0,46.2 226.4,45.8 229.8,45.3 233.2,45.0 236.6,44.7 240.0,44.4 243.4,44.3 246.8,44.2 250.2,44.1' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='46.0,44.1 49.4,44.2 52.8,44.3 56.2,44.4 59.6,44.7 63.0,45.0 66.4,45.3 69.8,45.8 73.2,46.2 76.6,46.8 80.0,47.4 83.4,48.1 86.8,48.9 90.2,49.7 93.6,50.6 97.1,51.5 100.5,52.5 103.9,53.5 107.3,54.7 110.7,55.8 114.1,57.1 117.5,58.4 120.9,59.7 124.3,61.1 127.7,62.6 131.1,64.1 134.5,65.7 137.9,67.3 141.3,68.9 144.7,70.7 148.1,72.4 151.5,74.2 154.9,76.1 158.3,78.0 161.7,79.9 165.1,81.9 168.5,83.9 171.9,86.0 175.3,88.1 178.7,90.2 182.1,92.4 185.5,94.6 188.9,96.9 192.3,99.1 195.7,101.4 199.2,103.7 202.6,106.1 206.0,108.5 209.4,110.9 212.8,113.3 216.2,115.7 219.6,118.2 223.0,120.6 226.4,123.1 229.8,125.6 233.2,128.1 236.6,130.6 240.0,133.1 243.4,135.6 246.8,138.2 250.2,140.7' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='148.1' cy='72.4' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='140.1' y='64.4'>π/4</text><text x='234.5' y='36.4' fill='#2f6df0' font-size='10'>sen x</text><text x='52.5' y='32.6' fill='#f0a30a' font-size='10'>cos x</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 140.7H294.0M46.0 174.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='176.0' y1='137.7' x2='176.0' y2='143.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='173.0' y='154.7' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='43.0' y1='44.1' x2='49.0' y2='44.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='30.0' y='48.1' font-size='10'>1</text></svg></div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Hasta \\(\\frac\\pi4\\) va por encima el coseno, y después el seno:</p>\\[A=\\int_0^{\\pi/4}(\\cos x-\\mathrm{sen}\\,x)\\,dx+\\int_{\\pi/4}^{\\pi/2}(\\mathrm{sen}\\,x-\\cos x)\\,dx=\\bigl[\\mathrm{sen}\\,x+\\cos x\\bigr]_0^{\\pi/4}+\\bigl[-\\cos x-\\mathrm{sen}\\,x\\bigr]_{\\pi/4}^{\\pi/2}\\]\\[=(\\sqrt2-1)+(-1+\\sqrt2)=2\\sqrt2-2\\]<div class='res'>Área total \\(=2\\sqrt2-2\\approx0{,}828\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"integ","tipo":"area","apartados":"a, b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2012-RESERVA_1.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2012-reserva-1-3","n":3,"num":3,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Considera las matrices \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&2&0\\\\0&1&2\\\\1&2&1\\end{pmatrix}\\), \\(B=\\begin{pmatrix}0&1\\\\1&0\\end{pmatrix}\\) y \\(C=\\begin{pmatrix}-1&2&0\\\\1&1&2\\end{pmatrix}\\). Determina, si existe, la matriz \\(X\\) que verifica \\(AXB=C^t\\), siendo \\(C^t\\) la matriz traspuesta de \\(C\\).","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Si \\(A\\) y \\(B\\) son invertibles, \\(X=A^{-1}C^tB^{-1}\\). \\(|B|=-1\\neq0\\) y \\(B^{-1}=B\\) (porque \\(B^2=I\\)). Calculo \\(|A|\\) por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&2&0\\\\0&1&2\\\\1&2&1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(1+4+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(0+4+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=1\\]<p>Como \\(|A|\\neq0\\), existe la inversa: \\(A^{-1}=\\dfrac1{|A|}(\\operatorname{Adj}A)^t\\).</p>\\[\\operatorname{Adj}A=\\begin{pmatrix}-3 & 2 & -1\\\\-2 & 1 & 0\\\\4 & -2 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow A^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}-3 & -2 & 4\\\\2 & 1 & -2\\\\-1 & 0 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\]\\[C^tB^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}-1 & 1\\\\2 & 1\\\\0 & 2\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0 & 1\\\\1 & 0\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1 & -1\\\\1 & 2\\\\2 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\]\\[X=\\begin{pmatrix}-3 & -2 & 4\\\\2 & 1 & -2\\\\-1 & 0 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1 & -1\\\\1 & 2\\\\2 & 0\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}3 & -1\\\\-1 & 0\\\\1 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\]<div class='res'>Existe y es \\(X=\\begin{pmatrix}3 & -1\\\\-1 & 0\\\\1 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"ecmat","apartados":""},{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"inv","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2012-RESERVA_1.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2012-reserva-1-4","n":4,"num":4,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"El punto \\(M(1,-1,0)\\) es el centro de un paralelogramo y \\(A(2,1,-1)\\) y \\(B(0,-2,3)\\) son dos vértices consecutivos del mismo.","apartados":["(1 p.) Halla la ecuación general del plano que contiene al paralelogramo.","(1,5 p.) Determina uno de los otros dos vértices y calcula el área de dicho paralelogramo."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>El plano contiene a \\(\\overrightarrow{MA}=(1,2,-1)\\) y \\(\\overrightarrow{MB}=(-1,-1,3)\\):</p>\\[\\vec n=\\overrightarrow{MA}\\times\\overrightarrow{MB}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\1&2&-1\\\\-1&-1&3\\end{vmatrix}=(5,\\,-2,\\,1)\\]<p>Es de la forma \\(5x-2y+z+D=0\\) y contiene a \\(M\\): \\(5+2+D=0\\iff D=-7\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(5x-2y+z-7=0\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(M\\) es el punto medio de las diagonales<i class='n' data-t='th'>Las diagonales de un paralelogramo se cortan en su punto medio.</i>: \\(C=2M-A=(0,-3,1)\\) y \\(D=2M-B=(2,0,-3)\\).</p>\\[\\overrightarrow{AB}=(-2,-3,4),\\quad\\overrightarrow{AD}=(0,-1,-2),\\quad\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AD}=(10,\\,-4,\\,2)\\]\\[\\text{Área}=\\sqrt{100+16+4}=\\sqrt{120}=2\\sqrt{30}\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-21,\"el\":12,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[2,1,-1],[0,-2,3],[0,-3,1],[2,0,-3]],\"#f59e0b\",\"#b45309\"],[\"pt\",[2,1,-1],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,-2,3],\"B\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,-3,1],\"C\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[2,0,-3],\"D\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[1,-1,0],\"M\",8,14]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m12r1a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m12r1a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m12r1a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m12r1a4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='192.1,170.2 60.8,18.0 26.0,93.8 157.3,246.0' fill='#f59e0b' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#b45309' stroke-width='1.2'/><circle cx='192.1' cy='170.2' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='199.1' y='164.2' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='60.8' cy='18.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='67.8' y='12.0' font-weight='700'>B</text><circle cx='26.0' cy='93.8' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='33.0' y='87.8' font-weight='700'>C</text><circle cx='157.3' cy='246.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='164.3' y='240.0' font-weight='700'>D</text><circle cx='109.1' cy='132.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='117.1' y='146.0' font-weight='700'>M</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='29.7' y2='273.1' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='28.7' y='278.2' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='38.9' y2='268.8' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='41.2' y='272.4' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='254.3' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='252.9' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(C(0,-3,1)\\) (o \\(D(2,0,-3)\\)); área \\(=2\\sqrt{30}\\approx10{,}95\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"geom","tipo":"ecs","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"geom","tipo":"vec","apartados":"b"},{"tema":"geom","tipo":"area","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2012-RESERVA_1.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2012-reserva-1-5","n":5,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sea \\(f\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=\\dfrac{2x^2}{(x+1)(x-2)}\\) para \\(x\\neq-1\\) y \\(x\\neq2\\).","apartados":["(1 p.) Estudia y calcula las asíntotas de la gráfica de \\(f\\).","(1 p.) Determina los intervalos de crecimiento y de decrecimiento de \\(f\\).","(0,5 p.) Calcula, si existe, algún punto de la gráfica de \\(f\\) donde ésta corta a la asíntota horizontal."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p><b>Verticales:</b> el denominador se anula en \\(x=-1\\) y \\(x=2\\), y el numerador no: \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to-1}f(x)=\\frac2{0}=\\infty\\), \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to2}f(x)=\\frac80=\\infty\\). Son asíntotas verticales.</p><p><b>Horizontal:</b> \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}\\frac{2x^2}{x^2-x-2}=2\\): \\(y=2\\). No hay oblicuas.</p><div class='res'>Asíntotas verticales \\(x=-1\\) y \\(x=2\\); asíntota horizontal \\(y=2\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(x=-1\\) y \\(x=2\\) son puntos «problemáticos»<i class='n' data-t='why'>Los puntos «problemáticos» son los que no pertenecen al dominio (por ejemplo, los que anulan un denominador) y los puntos donde cambia la expresión de una función a trozos. Hay que marcarlos en la recta porque en ellos también puede cambiar el signo de la derivada.</i>. Estudiamos el signo de \\(f'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>.</p>\\[f'(x)=\\frac{4x(x^2-x-2)-2x^2(2x-1)}{(x^2-x-2)^2}=\\frac{-2x(x+4)}{(x^2-x-2)^2}=0\\iff\\boxed{x=0},\\ \\boxed{x=-4}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 438 108' width='100%' style='max-width:526px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H424' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M96 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='96' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>−4</text><path d='M178 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='178' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>−1</text><circle cx='178' cy='52' r='4.5' fill='var(--card,#fff)' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M260 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='260' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>0</text><path d='M342 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='342' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>2</text><circle cx='342' cy='52' r='4.5' fill='var(--card,#fff)' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='29.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M43.0 10L79.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M70.0 39L79.0 40L77.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='55.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(−5) &lt; 0</text><text x='111.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M125.0 40L161.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M152.0 11L161.0 10L159.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='137.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(−2) &gt; 0</text><text x='193.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M207.0 40L243.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M234.0 11L243.0 10L241.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='219.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(−½) &gt; 0</text><text x='275.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M289.0 10L325.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M316.0 39L325.0 40L323.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='301.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(1) &lt; 0</text><text x='357.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M371.0 10L407.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M398.0 39L407.0 40L405.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='383.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(3) &lt; 0</text></svg></div><p>\\(f\\) decrece en \\((-\\infty,-4)\\), \\((0,2)\\) y \\((2,+\\infty)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\lt0\\), y crece en \\((-4,-1)\\) y \\((-1,0)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\gt0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece en él; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i>.</p><div class='res'>Crece en \\((-4,-1)\\cup(-1,0)\\); decrece en \\((-\\infty,-4)\\cup(0,2)\\cup(2,+\\infty)\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado 